<title>FRANCE: Non-residents net buyers French govt bonds in Feb.</title>
<headline>Non-residents net buyers French govt bonds in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Figures released by the finance ministry showed non-resident investors bought a net 3.47 billion francs of French government bonds (OATs and BTANs) in February.</p>
<p>The ministry gave the following unadjusted breakdown (in billions of francs) of the financial account in its balance of payment figures.</p>
<p>						  Feb	Jan   Feb 96</p>
<p> DIRECT INVESTMENT			 -5.80     5.69   -2.04</p>
<p>     - French investment abroad	-5.36    -2.20  -12.57</p>
<p>     - foreign investment in France  -0.44     7.89   10.53</p>
<p> PORTFOLIO INVESTMENT		    -7.90   -18.90  -25.34</p>
<p>  Residents in foreign securities   -24.01   -32.47   -2.39</p>
<p>     - shares				-2.43   -15.41   -0.97</p>
<p>     - bonds				-21.35   -20.32  -17.10</p>
<p>     - money market instruments	 0.20     4.99   15.32</p>
<p>     - derivative products	     -0.43    -1.73    0.37</p>
<p>  Non-residents in French securities 16.11    13.57  -22.96</p>
<p>     - shares				12.43     6.04   -0.59</p>
<p>     - bonds				  6.87     5.90  -22.98</p>
<p>     - govt securities(OATs, BTANs)   3.47     7.35  -24.45</p>
<p>     - money market instruments	-3.19     1.63    0.61</p>
<p> OTHER INVESTMENTS			-13.86   -30.24   12.70</p>
<p> - Credits				   61.85   -86.56  -40.50</p>
<p> - Liabilities			    -48.00    56.32   53.20</p>
<p> RESERVE ASSETS			    -4.25    -3.04   -0.15</p>
<p> TOTAL FINANCIAL ACCOUNT		 -4.08   -46.49  -14.84</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
